  "boundaries": [
    "No formal app, real Agent, user repository, original user database, credentials or installed application was operated by this backend work. Git tests use disposable repositories; ACP tests use a controlled protocol peer.",
    "macOS-specific Git implementation only. No Windows execution or filesystem proof is claimed.",
    "Own-application admission and process ownership do not establish exclusive control over external editors, commands or filesystems. Pre/post evidence detects observed changes; it is not an OS-wide lock.",
    "Retaining a directory is not an independent recoverable Git snapshot. Shared repository objects/refs remain dependencies. Permanent deletion and validated recovery material including private refs/reflogs remain future required work.",
    "Material scan is bounded at 100000 entries / 1 GiB total / 256 MiB per regular file / depth 64. It rejects submodules, nested repositories and special files. Material digest includes inode identity, bytes, link target and mode; no independent xattr restoration or cross-filesystem reconstruction is claimed.",
    "Cold settled/inactive means this instance owns no running maintenance worker; it does not prove an earlier crashed process stopped. Unknown records require explicit review/recheck and never restart automatically.",
    "Final broad engineering, candidate, installation and installed H15 UI/Git verification are root-owned and remain pending."
  ],
